:{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/1342","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/1342","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/1342.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/1342.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The project checker accepted the exact assigned statement locally.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/1342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/1342/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10739","id":6593533781,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRsJQrA","number":10739,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 to forty extremal input rows","user":{"login":"Ulsancl","id":181699993,"node_id":"U_kgDOCtSFmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181699993?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl","html_url":"https://github.com/Ulsancl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulsancl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-24T23:29:59Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:29:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/10739","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10739","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10739.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10739.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Sixteen minimal positive rows and twenty-four maximal independent sets suffice to test an arbitrary monotone Boolean function against the target. Monotonicity propagates the positive tests upward and the negative tests downward. The negative tests also characterize, for each wire separately, whether it can turn on away from the edge function. I checked this first child against the exact emitted Lean statement.\n\nThe second child asks for a top-form circuit of at most 21 gates in the assigned shard of at least three junk AND gates. The output must pass the forty fixed tests. A 22-gate star circuit was checked separately as an upper bound. The 21-gate search remains open.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10739/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8019","id":6587451065,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRnP1sg","number":8019,"title":"L-meta-1342: reduce shard 1 to a finite critical-input witness","user":{"login":"maibu2019","id":52164289,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTY0Mjg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52164289?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019","html_url":"https://github.com/maibu2019","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maibu2019/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T17:19:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:24:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/8019","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8019","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8019.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8019.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"L-meta-1342의 할당된 범위 1을 두 명제로 환원합니다. 첫째, 이 단조 함수는 간선의 두 끝점 입력 16개와 극대 독립집합 입력 24개에서의 값으로 결정됩니다. 둘째, 이 40개 검사를 만족하며 junk AND가 3개 이상인 유한 회로 코드가 존재합니다. 코드는 게이트 수 0..21, 선택적 입력 두 개, AND/OR 연산, 0..32 출력선을 사용합니다.\n\n검증: Lean 모듈 빌드와 공식 gap/import/plain 검사를 통과했습니다. 정규화한 하위 명제는 1427자와 1852자입니다. 40개 입력 판정법은 별도 로컬 Lean 증명도 통과했습니다. SAT 탐색은 시간 제한으로 미결이며, 반례 발견이나 범위 소진을 주장하지 않습니다. 두 하위 명제가 모두 증명되어야 원래 단계가 완성됩니다.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8019/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11248","id":6594947326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRtRBiw","number":11248,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 to a finite two-junk circuit witness and boundary verification","user":{"login":"nubok","id":100853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDg1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok","html_url":"https://github.com/nubok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nubok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:23Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/11248","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11248","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11248.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11248.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This reduces the 21-gate upper-bound task to a finite circuit witness on 40 boundary inputs and a general monotone boundary-verification lemma. The finite premise preserves strict binary reads, exactly two junk AND gates, and the TopForm restriction for the assigned shard. The reduction proves the posted conclusion exactly and includes bitwise circuit-evaluation correctness.\n\nThe boundary premise has a separate locally compiled Lean proof. Finding the finite 21-gate witness remains open.\n\nValidation: pinned Lean/Lake module build and the public outside-guard passed. A supplemental audit checked the exact conclusion, two independent closed premises (1428 and898 printed characters), strict print/read roundtrips, permitted constant owners, absence of extra declarations, and axioms limited to propext and Quot.sound. The authoritative project verdict is still required.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11248/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10537","id":6592957959,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRrrtww","number":10537,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 shard 1 to a live prefix and an AND frontier","user":{"login":"anItalianGeek","id":170751150,"node_id":"U_kgDOCi10rg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170751150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek","html_url":"https://github.com/anItalianGeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anItalianGeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T22:48:18Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:59:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/10537","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10537","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10537.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/10537.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The remaining witness is a prefix of lower gates and a list of pairs of wires for the frontier AND gates. The prefix must contain at least three junk ANDs in the cone of that frontier. The compiler adds the frontier and its final binary OR tree with cost 2*T-1 for T frontier gates.\n\nThe kernel checks monotonicity and sufficiency of the 16 minimal positive rows and 24 maximal independent negative rows. The frontier compiler has a separate local Lean proof. The resulting witness search remains open.\n\nThe pinned checker reported ACCEPTED (reduce) with two children.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/10537/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4672","id":6578151621,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRfs15w","number":4672,"title":"L-meta-1342: reduce the three-junk circuit search to boundary tests","user":{"login":"m-simonelli","id":60584156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTg0MTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60584156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli","html_url":"https://github.com/m-simonelli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-simonelli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-24T08:56:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T18:22:46Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T18:22:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/4672","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4672","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4672.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Reduction for `L-meta-1342`, shard 1. Please run the authoritative checker in `reduce` mode.\n\nThis restricts synthesis to the assigned shard of top-form circuits with at least three junk AND gates. The output tests are the 16 edge pairs and the 24 maximal independent sets, for 40 assignments altogether. The general completion lemma extends these tests to all inputs by monotonicity and builds locally with the pinned Lean toolchain.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5765","id":6580694914,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRhw2Rw","number":5765,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 to three marked ANDs and an 18-gate remainder","user":{"login":"steveDOTdigital","id":18422674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDIyNjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18422674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital","html_url":"https://github.com/steveDOTdigital","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steveDOTdigital/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T11:25:07Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:44:21Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T15:44:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/5765","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5765","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5765.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5765.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Independent reduction of L-meta-1342, shard 1 of 2. Mark three AND gates that each fire on an input where the target is false. Removing these three marks leaves four consecutive blocks with at most eighteen gates in total. The first child proves that the blocks and marks can be reassembled while preserving evaluation and size. The second asks for a synthesis witness with at least four additional ANDs among those blocks.\n\nThe [proof, Lean assembler, and reproducible searches](https://github.com/steveDOTdigital/pequalnp-proofs/blob/d73e2ce65cac026f4c8c0c101ee3a61f24a48ae1/notes/eleven-dirty-ports.md) establish that seven binary ANDs are necessary even with unrestricted free ORs and sharing. CaDiCaL reported UNSAT for six ANDs with internal LRAT checking enabled. The seven-AND, 22-gate control passed all 2,048 inputs. A separate counting argument requires at least seven binary ORs when ANDs are free.\n\nThe project’s local checker accepted two children and rechecked 1,607 constants. Lean also verified the exact first child against the linked assembler. The bounded search for a 21-gate circuit with three dirty ANDs timed out. That existence question remains open.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5765/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8000","id":6587396503,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRnNBug","number":8000,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 to five shared input ORs and a 13-gate completion","user":{"login":"ramic-k","id":41784132,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzg0MTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41784132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k","html_url":"https://github.com/ramic-k","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramic-k/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T17:16:24Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:10:06Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T21:10:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/8000","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8000","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8000.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/8000.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Reduce the 21-gate search for L-meta-1342 to two statements. The first asks for five raw-input ORs, three marked ANDs, six further ORs and four output terms. Each marked AND must fire on a negative input. The second realizes the final six ORs, four ANDs and three output ORs as a 13-gate circuit. The reduction constructs the eight initial gates and checks the edge table against the posted statement.\n\nI checked a 22-gate example in Lean with this arrangement and seven further ORs. Its five raw ORs use the pairs (6,9), (7,10), (5,8), (4,5) and (8,10). I also built a Lean proof of the 13-gate constructor locally. The six-OR witness remains open.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8000/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5835","id":6580910562,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRh8ATw","number":5835,"title":"Reduce L-meta-1342 to dirty gates and a cover of the 16 positive rows","user":{"login":"jarusoa","id":135768676,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBeqZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135768676?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa","html_url":"https://github.com/jarusoa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jarusoa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T11:38:33Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:23:35Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T12:23:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/5835","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5835","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5835.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5835.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"For shard 1, search only among gates that are true on at least one maximal independent input. At least three of those gates must be ANDs. The clean output is an OR of t pairwise intersections from this pool and the raw inputs. With K intermediate gates the circuit costs exactly K+2t−1, so the finite search has K+2t≤22 and at most nine intersections.\n\nThe 40-row boundary criterion and the generic circuit constructor have separate Lean proofs. The constructor accepts shared operands and adds exactly t ANDs and t−1 ORs. The remaining child asks for an actual 21-gate witness, which is open. A 24-gate control with three dirty ANDs passed all 2,048 inputs.\n\nThe earlier boundary-only and three-marked-gate reductions retain the internal clean circuit; this child removes its intermediate gates and its output tree from the search.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5835/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}